# ── QUEST LOG ENTRY ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every commit that changes tests/ needs one. Write it in your own words.
#
# Line 1    level-NN: a short summary (at least 3 words)
#           e.g.  level-03: catch the shapeshifter with pytest.raises
#           Use  boss:  instead of  level-NN:  for Final Boss work.
#
# What:     What did you do? Which tests did you add or change?
# Why:      Why do these tests catch the monsters? Why this technique?
#           (What and Why need at least 5 words each.)
# Learned:  Optional. Something you learned, or got stuck on.
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Save and close the editor to commit.
# Close it without changing anything to cancel the commit.
